---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/hero/Hero.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Rishabh Singh Kushwaha"
  description="Backend engineer. A real-time motion-planning stack for unstructured Indian roads, and a clinical decision-support system whose safety path never depends on model output."
>
  <Hero />

  <main class="shell">
    <section class="scaffold">
      <p class="eyebrow">Next</p>
      <h2>The rest of the deck</h2>
      <p>
        Sarathi, Brahmo and winter-chat land here as keycap sections, then the
        stack, the writing placeholder and the footer wordmark. The hero above is
        the piece that had to be right first — everything below inherits its
        tokens.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  main {
    padding-block: clamp(60px, 12vh, 140px);
  }
  .scaffold h2 {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
</style>
